d=3D"1">
                                                            <p>Web design f=
ocuses on the user experience and user flow, as well as the aesthetic appea=
rance of the site. Web development, on the other hand, involves the technic=
al side that makes the website function, including coding and performance a=
cross devices. Both are essential for creating a successful, user-friendly =
website.</p>                                                        </div>
