icating that up to 80% of your website=E2=80=99s visitors may access it fir=
st on a phone. First impressions are key, so it=E2=80=99s vital that your s=
ite looks professional and is easy to navigate on mobile. Additionally, sea=
rch engines prioritize mobile-friendly design and may lower your ranking if=
