tes with custom backend features, such as job portals or marketplaces.</p>
<p>Costs vary based on the hourly rate and the total hours required. For in=
stance, an informational site may take between 200 and 400 hours. If an age=
ncy charges $150 per hour, the starting cost would be approximately $30,000=
